I did not implement either operations request. This node holds only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`. It has no filesystem or HTTP import, and the target has no WASI, so writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or calling the metadata service would need capabilities the node was not granted. Logging the question and sending it to an external service would also leak input outside the node's declared scope. If operations needs these, the graph would have to grant the node the relevant capabilities (for example `http-client` and a log or notifier sink).

